{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17560","headline":"题武担寺西台 · 段文昌","name":"题武担寺西台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋天如镜空，楼阁尽玲珑。\n水暗余霞外，山明落照中。\n鸟行看渐远，松韵听难穷。\n今日登临意，多欢语笑同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"段文昌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17560.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17560","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}